  "description": "Beating Benchmarks With E-Power The name SCARP is very well-known among race fully enthusiasts. Now, with the lightweight SX Drive Unit, the Scarp Carbon bikes are finally available with motor, but without compromising their proven qualities. The various models unite the best of both worlds, combining high performance with assistance. 140mm of travel offer extra trail fun and a hint of freeride feeling. The Macina SX product line complements KTM's established e-bike range, revolutionizing the electric bike riding experience with agility and lightness in focus. With a clean frame design and the BOSCH Performance Line SX Drive Unit, the Macina SX models embody innovation and a drive for perfection, blending sportiness with elegance. The Macina SX strikes a perfect balance between lightweight construction and impressive, natural power output. These models also feature KTM’s own POWER TUBE TOP LOADER (PTTL) innovation, which provides user-friendly battery handling. The CompactTube 400Wh battery can be easily removed from the top of the frametube, simplifying the process of removal and reinsertion, making it easy to bring a spare battery for longer tours. KTM also offers clever solutions from their accessories range for this purpose: the Battery Board backpack insert is specifically designed to securely carry a spare battery. Another way to extend the range is the BOSCH PowerMore Range Extender with 250Wh, which can be mounted directly on the battery cover. The charging port has been adapted to support this feature. E-mountain biking has never been so light.",
